{{!-- The identifying-facts strip: where a person is, and the name their
      competition results were recorded under when it differs from the name on
      the page. It sits directly under the hero on the pages others read; on a
      member's own profile it opens the Identity & History section, beside the
      rest of their linked history. Receives the page's heroData; the
      service has already withheld city and region from a visitor who may not
      see them. --}}
{{#if (or heroData.historicalPersonName (or heroData.city (or heroData.region heroData.country)))}}
<div class="event-meta-row">
  {{#if (or heroData.city (or heroData.region heroData.country))}}<span>{{#if heroData.city}}{{heroData.city}}{{#if heroData.region}}, {{heroData.region}}{{/if}}{{#if heroData.country}} · {{heroData.country}}{{/if}}{{else if heroData.region}}{{heroData.region}}{{#if heroData.country}} · {{heroData.country}}{{/if}}{{else}}{{heroData.country}}{{/if}}</span>{{/if}}
  {{#if heroData.historicalPersonName}}<span>Competition record: {{heroData.historicalPersonName}}</span>{{/if}}
</div>
{{/if}}
